000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. SRT2.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT W-FILE ASSIGN TO "sort2_in.dat".
000700     SELECT IN-F ASSIGN TO "sort2_in.dat".
000800     SELECT SRT ASSIGN TO "sort2_tmp.dat".
000900 DATA DIVISION.
001000 FILE SECTION.
001100 FD W-FILE.
001200 01 W-REC.
001300    05 W-NAME PIC X(5).
001400    05 W-AGE PIC 99.
001500 FD IN-F.
001600 01 IN-REC.
001700    05 I-NAME PIC X(5).
001800    05 I-AGE PIC 99.
001900 SD SRT.
002000 01 SRT-REC.
002100    05 S-NAME PIC X(5).
002200    05 S-AGE PIC 99.
002300 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002400 01 EOF-FLAG PIC 9 VALUE 0.
002500    88 AT-EOF VALUE 1.
002600 01 DONE-FLAG PIC 9 VALUE 0.
002700    88 ALL-DONE VALUE 1.
002800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002900 MAIN.
003000     OPEN OUTPUT W-FILE.
003100     MOVE "BOB" TO W-NAME. MOVE 30 TO W-AGE. WRITE W-REC.
003200     MOVE "AL" TO W-NAME. MOVE 25 TO W-AGE. WRITE W-REC.
003300     MOVE "EV" TO W-NAME. MOVE 20 TO W-AGE. WRITE W-REC.
003400     MOVE "CY" TO W-NAME. MOVE 31 TO W-AGE. WRITE W-REC.
003500     CLOSE W-FILE.
003600     SORT SRT ON DESCENDING KEY S-AGE
003700         INPUT PROCEDURE IS IN-PROC
003800         OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS OUT-PROC.
003900     DISPLAY "DONE".
004000     STOP RUN.
004100 IN-PROC.
004200     OPEN INPUT IN-F.
004300     PERFORM UNTIL AT-EOF
004400         READ IN-F
004500             AT END SET AT-EOF TO TRUE
004600             NOT AT END
004700                 IF I-AGE >= 25
004800                     MOVE I-NAME TO S-NAME
004900                     MOVE I-AGE TO S-AGE
005000                     RELEASE SRT-REC
005100                 END-IF
005200         END-READ
005300     END-PERFORM.
005400     CLOSE IN-F.
005500 OUT-PROC.
005600     PERFORM UNTIL ALL-DONE
005700         RETURN SRT
005800             AT END SET ALL-DONE TO TRUE
005900             NOT AT END DISPLAY S-NAME " " S-AGE
006000         END-RETURN
006100     END-PERFORM.
